@startuml system-architecture
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName DejaVu Sans
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 14
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.3
skinparam nodesep 55
skinparam ranksep 60
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFBEB
skinparam noteBorderColor #D4AF37
skinparam titleFontSize 25
skinparam titleFontColor #0F172A
skinparam footerFontColor #64748B
top to bottom direction
title Automatic LoRA Training Pipeline\n<size:15>Style customization | 100-1,000 images | shared pool of 2-4 GPUs</size>

actor "User / client" as User #E2E8F0
component "API + authentication\nUpload sessions and job admission\nStatus, cancellation, model access" as API #DBEAFE
database "PostgreSQL\nMetadata + durable stage queue\nLeases, budgets, registry records" as DB #DBEAFE
component "Scheduler + reconciler\nActive instance + standby\nFair dispatch, guarded claims, retries" as Scheduler #DBEAFE
component "CPU workers\nPREPARE: inspect, deduplicate, split\nPUBLISH: verify and register" as CPU #E2E8F0
node "GPU host agents / isolated containers\n\nONE SHARED POOL: 2-4 DEVICE SLOTS\nCAPTION (optional) | TRAIN | EVALUATE\nEvaluation includes inference-load smoke test\n\nOne stage per GPU; one current attempt per job\nExclusive device locks + lease watchdogs" as GPU #F3E8FF
storage "S3-compatible object storage\nTenant-scoped images and manifests\nCheckpoints, adapters, reports\nImmutable versions + checksums" as Objects #E0F2FE
component "Logical model registry\nREADY versions only\nAdapter + base revision + loading manifest" as Registry #DCFCE7
component "Existing inference consumer\nLoad compatible approved adapter\nOnline serving fleet is outside scope" as Inference #F1F5F9
component "Observability\nQueue age / GPU use / lease loss\nQuality / budgets / audit trail" as Observe #FEF3C7

' Ranking follows the control flow; feedback edges do not determine ranks.
User -down-> API : 1  Request upload URLs\nSubmit / poll / cancel
API -right-> DB : 2  Atomic job + task creation\nIdempotency / status reads
API -[hidden]down-> Scheduler
Scheduler -[#64748B,dashed,norank]-> DB : 3  Poll / claim tasks\nLeases + budget reservations
Scheduler -down-> CPU : Dispatch CPU stages
Scheduler -down-> GPU : 4  GPU stage dispatch\nToken + lease + deadline
CPU -[hidden]right-> GPU
GPU -[#0284C7,dashed]right-> Objects : 5  Read pinned inputs\nWrite checkpoint / adapter / report
CPU -down-> Registry : 6  Full PASS + smoke evidence\nVerify artifacts and publish
GPU -[hidden]down-> Registry
Registry -down-> Inference : 7  Authorized versioned handoff
Objects -[hidden]down-> Observe

User -[#0284C7,dashed,norank]-> Objects : Direct upload\nScoped, expiring URLs
CPU -[#0284C7,dashed,norank]-> Objects : Images / prepared manifests
CPU -[#64748B,dashed,norank]-> DB : CPU heartbeat + fenced completion\nBind manifest and enqueue successor
GPU -[#64748B,dashed,norank]-> DB : GPU heartbeat + fenced completion\nAtomically enqueue next stage
Registry -[#64748B,dashed,norank]-> DB : Model READY + job READY\nOne guarded transaction
Registry -[#0284C7,dashed,norank]-> Objects : Checksummed artifact references
API -[#64748B,dashed,norank]-> Registry : Authorized lookup
Scheduler -[#D97706,dotted,norank]-> Observe : Controller metrics
GPU -[#D97706,dotted,norank]-> Observe : Worker metrics / logs

legend bottom left
  |= Color |= Responsibility |
  | Blue | Control plane and durable state |
  | Purple | All GPU stages share one finite pool |
  | Green | Quality-gated delivery boundary |
  | Blue dashed links | Direct artifact transfer |
  | Gray links | Control / metadata (key paths shown) |
  Logical components may share a process; registry is backed by PostgreSQL + object storage.
  GPU class cycle: EVALUATE, TRAIN, CAPTION, TRAIN; fair user rotation within each class.
  Lost leases fence results; unconfirmed devices quarantine until termination is confirmed.
endlegend
footer DESIGN PROPOSAL | Model / hardware neutral | No measured throughput or quality claims
@enduml
